<title>JAPAN: Fujimac - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Fujimac - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.13		vs	   15.31</p>
<p> Operating	  431    million    vs	  286    million</p>
<p> Current	    356    million    vs	  276    million</p>
